  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Ensuring continuity and impact of the OECD responsible minerals implementation programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action aims to sustain global coordination on responsible mineral supply chains by supporting two OECD flagship mechanisms: the 2027 OECD Forum and the 12th I-LEN meeting. Its key objectives are to advance implementation of the OECD Minerals Guidance, strengthen dialogue among governments, industry, civil society and law enforcement, improve detection and disruption of minerals-related crime, promote accountability and inclusivity, and link responsible sourcing with critical minerals resilience, traceability, anti-corruption, financial integrity and sustainable development in conflict-affected and high-risk areas. FPI is providing this transitional support to phase out its funding to OECD in this area. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
